   327
   328 						;Test underflow
   329 						;
   330 						;There is arguably a bug in the base OS where multiplying two numbers
   331 						;where the composite byte exponent is below -65 results in an error
   332 						;even though it is an underflow. For this reason, we avoid using such
   333 						;tiny numbers and use ones big enough to cause underflow without an
   334 						;error.
   335 						
