   518 						
   519 						; Atari precisely specified in its OS Manual that FPI is supposed to
   520 						; give an error for FR0 >= 65535.5. That assumes their implementation
   521 						; actually follows the spec, which it doesn't -- it gives 0 for values
   522 						; between 65535.5 and 65536.
